om/users/johnaohara","html_url":"https://github.com/johnaohara","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnaohara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnaohara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnaohara/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnaohara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnaohara/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnaohara/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnaohara/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnaohara/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnaohara/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/milestones/29","html_url":"https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/milestone/29","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/milestones/29/labels","id":4572724,"node_id":"MDk6TWlsZXN0b25lNDU3MjcyNA==","number":29,"title":"0.23.0","description":"","creator":{"login":"gsmet","id":1279749,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzk3NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1279749?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet","html_url":"https://github.com/gsmet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":358,"state":"closed","created_at":"2019-08-14T13:51:00Z","updated_at":"2019-11-26T14:46:07Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2019-09-25T20:28:18Z"},"comments":0,"created_at":"2019-09-05T14:42:03Z","updated_at":"2019-09-10T00:53:31Z","closed_at":"2019-09-10T00:53:31Z","author_association":"MEMBER","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"When deploying the `getting-started` application in OpenShift, I have seen that the new network stack version required 24Mb or memory instead of 12Mb to serve the requests.  With 12Mb, `OutOfMemory` exception are thrown.\r\n\r\n**How to reproduce it**\r\n\r\n1. You need an OpenShift cluster somewhere (I used crc), and `oc` connected to it.\r\n2. Create a new project with `oc new-project some-quarkus-test`\r\n3. Creates a build config with:\r\n```\r\noc new-build --name=my-application \\\r\n  --binary=true \\\r\n  --docker-image=quay.io/quarkus/ubi-quarkus-native-binary-s2i:19.2.0\r\n```\r\n4. Go to the quickstarts, start with the `master` branch, build the native image (generate a linux64 executable with `mvn clean install -Pnative -Dnative-image.docker-build=true`)\r\n5. Creates a `target/.s2i/environment` file with:\r\n```\r\nQUARKUS_OPTS=-Xmx12M -Xms8M -Xmn12M\r\n```\r\n6. Deploy the application with:\r\n```\r\noc start-build my-application --from-dir target\r\noc new-app -i my-application\r\noc expose svc/my-application\r\n```\r\n7. Test the application, it should work\r\n\r\nNow, switch to the `development` branch, and rebuild the application:\r\n`mvn install -Pnative -Dnative-image.docker-build=true` (don't clean)\r\n\r\n8. Redeploy the application with:\r\n```\r\noc start-build my-application --from-dir target\r\n```\r\n\r\nTest the application, it will fail.\r\n\r\nIf you edit the `QUARKUS_OPTS` application to `QUARKUS_OPTS=-Xmx24M -Xms16M -Xmn24M` and restart the build, it works.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"stuartwdouglas","id":328571,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyODU3MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/328571?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartwdouglas","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartwdouglas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartwdouglas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartwdouglas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartwdouglas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartwdouglas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartwdouglas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartwdouglas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartwdouglas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartwdouglas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartwdouglas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/3881/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/3881/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}